      "changelog": "Version 1.0.0 of nm-minister-github-initiative-pulse\n\n- Initial release of the github-initiative-pulse skill, ported from claude-night-market/minister.\n- Generates markdown digests and CSV exports for GitHub issues, PRs, and initiative health tracking.\n- Includes Blocker Radar and risk tracking with key initiative-level metrics.\n- Provides integration with GitHub Projects for automated tracking and reporting.\n- Supports posting structured updates directly into GitHub issues, PRs, or Discussions.\n- Includes troubleshooting tips for syncing and markdown rendering issues.",
